com/users/HolonProduction/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproducible in: 4.7.2 stable\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.7.2.stable - Windows 10 (build 19045) - Multi-window, 2 monitors - Direct3D 12 (Forward+) - dedicated NVIDIA GeForce RTX 4070 Ti (NVIDIA; 32.0.15.8180) - 13th Gen Intel(R) Core(TM) i7-13700K (24 threads) - 63.77 GiB memory - WASAPI (48000 Hz, Stereo/mono)\n\n### Issue description\n\nA crash when trying deleting a Lua-style line in a dictionary definition with specific criteria around it.\nThis requires the dictionary be typed with an enum defined in the class and specifying the key type as ```Dictionary[ThisClass.Enum, ...]```\nMaking the typed dictionary as ```Dictionary[Enum, ...]``` does not seem to cause the engine to crash on removing the faulty line.\nThis also requires further criteria specified in Steps to reproduce.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nMake a typed dictionary with mixed Lua-style definition and key types as an enum defined in the same script while specifying the class the enum belongs to. With a Lua-style line at the end.\n```gdscript\nvar dict : Dictionary[CrashingClass.MyEnum, String] = {\nCrashingClass.MyEnum.ONE: \"1\",\nCrashingClass.MyEnum.TWO: \"Something\",\n\"0\" = \"0\", # This line is improper.\n};\n```\nAnd trying to remove the improper line results in the engine crashing if a reference to the class exists in a class the class references and it is interacting with that reference to itself.\nExample:\n```gdscript\nCrashingClass script\nfunc fizz() -> CrashingClass:\n    return Global.new_crashing_class();\n\nGlobal script\nfunc new_crashing_class() -> CrashingClass:\n    return CrashingClass.new(); # It does not matter what is actually returned here, what matters is the return type.\n```\nAnother way to create it is through an inherited class\n```gdscript\nCrashingClass script\nfunc fizz() -> CrashingClass2:\n    return null;\n\nCrashingClass2 script\nclass_name CrashingClass2;\nextends CrashingClass;\n# This is all that is required.\n```\n\nIn the MRP, try to delete the ```\"0\" = \"0\"``` line in dict_crasher.gd in one edit.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[dictionary_crash_2026-08-25_22-36-12.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/31446822/dictionary_crash_2026-08-25_22-36-12.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122821/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122821/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}